BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Moromete Family 3
DTSTART:20251108T030000Z
DTEND:20251108T051000Z
DTSTAMP:20251108T030000Z
UID:qOomCgcYlc
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 112 mins (1h52m)\n\nRomanian Film Festival Seattle S
 haken in his own political convictions\, Niculae Moromete is faced with gr
 owing distrust in the literary guild\, increasingly influenced by the ideo
 logical shifts of the Stalinist time. The film completes Stere Gulea’s p
 revious adaptations of Marin Preda’s renowned novels. Q&A with producer 
 Tudor Giurgiu.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/romanian-film-fe
 stival-seattle/the-moromete-family-3-father-and-son\n\nEstimated start: 19
 :15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Spruce Forest
DTSTART:20251108T200000Z
DTEND:20251108T213000Z
DTSTAMP:20251108T200000Z
UID:rqqdVOF3cC
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 75 mins (1h15m)\n\nRomanian Film Festival Seattle In
 spired by the 1941 Fântâna Albă tragedy\, the film recreates the strugg
 les faced by a Romanian community in Bessarabia while under Soviet occupat
 ion during WWII. A young couple gets separated when the wife and daughters
  are deported to Siberia\, leaving the husband guilt-ridden in Romania. Q&
 A with director Tudor Giurgiu.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/
 romanian-film-festival-seattle/the-spruce-forest\n\nEstimated start: 12:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:High School Thieves
DTSTART:20251108T221000Z
DTEND:20251109T001500Z
DTSTAMP:20251108T221000Z
UID:ytdON3Bstc
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 110 mins (1h50m)\n\nRomanian Film Festival Seattle F
 our teenagers sell the SAT prompts online to fund their dreams: college\, 
 a recording studio\, dad’s approval and adventure. Everything is going w
 ell until they are all forced to face the reality around them and the cons
 equences of their actions.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/roma
 nian-film-festival-seattle/high-school-thieves\n\nEstimated start: 14:25
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ink Wash
DTSTART:20251109T002500Z
DTEND:20251109T021000Z
DTSTAMP:20251109T002500Z
UID:VrCa0hcSBp
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 90 mins (1h30m)\n\nRomanian Film Festival Seattle Se
 eking shelter in her work from the pain of a breakup\, Lena\, a painter tu
 rning 40\, is commissioned to decorate a brutalist hotel nestled in the de
 pths of a Romanian forest. Lena’s moral views are confronted with an ove
 rwhelmingly corrupted community.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theater
 s/romanian-film-festival-seattle/ink-wash\n\nEstimated start: 16:40
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Dream
DTSTART:20251109T022000Z
DTEND:20251109T045500Z
DTSTAMP:20251109T022000Z
UID:c8RIMYCdRT
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 136 mins (2h16m)\n\nRomanian Film Festival Seattle A
 lex\, a downcast actor facing both romantic and professional failure\, sta
 rts an unusual creative project: staging a play inside a prison. What begi
 ns as an artistic experiment evolves into a transformative experience for 
 the inmates.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/romanian-film-fest
 ival-seattle/the-dream\n\nEstimated start: 18:35
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:TWST: Things We Said Today
DTSTART:20251109T192500Z
DTEND:20251109T210500Z
DTSTAMP:20251109T192500Z
UID:irL7SdtqhS
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 85 mins (1h25m)\n\nRomanian Film Festival Seattle TW
 ST takes as its starting point the arrival of the Beatles in New York for 
 their August 1965 concert at Shea Stadium. But the frame of reference stea
 dily broadens and adjacent realities of 1965 are juxtaposed—the New York
  World’s Fair and the Watts riots in Los Angeles.\n\nhttps://www.siff.ne
 t/cinema/in-theaters/romanian-film-festival-seattle/twst-things-we-said-to
 day\n\nEstimated start: 11:40
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Comatogen
DTSTART:20251109T210000Z
DTEND:20251109T230500Z
DTSTAMP:20251109T210000Z
UID:9UCM0Y8CxJ
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 110 mins (1h50m)\n\nRomanian Film Festival Seattle S
 ingle mother and nurse Alina is confronted with an ethical problem when sh
 e tries to find a huge sum of money to prevent her 22-year old son Radu fr
 om going to prison. Will Alina give in and abandon her faith and morality?
 \n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/romanian-film-festival-seattle
 /comatogen\n\nEstimated start: 13:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Moldovan Tales
DTSTART:20251109T233000Z
DTEND:20251110T013000Z
DTSTAMP:20251109T233000Z
UID:pulbZdA0Qq
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 104 mins (1h44m)\n\nRomanian Film Festival Seattle A
  diverse and hilarious cast of characters in contemporary Moldova encounte
 rs surprising opportunities and obstacles through a series of unexpected a
 dventures\, all capturing the essence of humor\, struggles\, and spirit of
  both rural and urban life. Q&A with director Natalia Shaufert.\n\nhttps:/
 /www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/romanian-film-festival-seattle/moldovan-t
 ales\n\nEstimated start: 15:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The New Year That Never Came
DTSTART:20251110T020000Z
DTEND:20251110T043500Z
DTSTAMP:20251110T020000Z
UID:23vjiXD6Xd
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 138 mins (2h18m)\n\nRomanian Film Festival Seattle I
 n December of 1989 Ceaușescu’s regime is on its last legs and any news 
 that reaches Bucharest is scant and sanitised. Six people find themselves 
 in the eye of the storm without realizing it. Q&A with cinematographer Bor
 oka Biro.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/romanian-film-festiva
 l-seattle/the-new-year-that-never-came\n\nEstimated start: 18:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
